OL,3,GNEWSATeenager jailed for life over
OL,4,Aambush murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDescribing the attack as "exceptionally
OL,7,Fviolent", she told Tajzai: "It is not
OL,8,Fsaid on your behalf, nor could it be,
OL,9,Fthat you had any justifiable or
OL,10,Fexcusable grievance against this man."
